  "bodyHash": "b1d5d47729cf6d14",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>欢迎来到掠夺者扩展！<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355754/description_60783b6f-bb19-4071-9397-07896ad71532.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"629\" height=\"260\"><br></strong></span></h1>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ef5f50\">欢迎来到掠夺者扩展！这是一个主要添加新掠夺者、一种新矿石和几件新武器的模组！</span></strong></h4>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>此模组需要 GeckoLib🦎 才能运行：</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files/7023453\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files/7023453</a></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><strong>掠夺者🪓：</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">报复者🛡：</span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355754/description_269a069e-2e7a-4166-9cda-a8d9ffd4c71d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"412\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">一名身穿盔甲的掠夺者，手持手斧和盾牌！<br><strong>能力：</strong><br>-随机格挡攻击。<br>-踢球。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>精英卫道士</strong>🪓：<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355754/description_bee0f15d-d043-4011-9c30-370529784e15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"485\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">一名装备更厚、戴着巨大金属头盔并挥舞双刃斧的卫道士！<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">能力：</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">-跃向目标然后猛击。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>精英洗劫者</strong>🎯：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355754/description_81bfe215-a87e-4ce9-ba69-8e8416fbf2c7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"269\" height=\"402\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">一名身穿金色护具并射击各种箭矢的掠夺者！<br><strong>能力：</strong><br>-侧移。<br>-射击随机箭矢。[普通 - 火焰 - 剧毒 - 炸弹]</span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>铜剑卫道士</strong>🤺：<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355754/description_ba6794f4-4a8c-4352-a00f-dd67679b3f8e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"211\" height=\"480\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">一名手持铁剑并配有铜制护具的掠夺者！<br></span><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>能力：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">-招架攻击。<br>-突刺。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">幻术师🏹：</span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355754/description_e5464146-ee57-4a37-ae15-6c7572a3af1e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"263\" height=\"675\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">一种被遗忘的生物，现在可以加入袭击以提供帮助！</span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">劫掠兽骑手🐂：</span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355754/description_18c67b8c-255a-420f-812a-655055d48cdc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"635\"><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">一个强大的Boss，会在袭击的第7波生成！<br><strong>能力：</strong><br>-远程近战。<br>-冲击波践踏。<br>-冲锋。<br>-咆哮。[版本 1.0.1.1]</span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><br>新功能：</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>添加了新类型的武器：<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">双刃斧🪓</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">卫道士有几率生成时持有双刃斧（石头或铁制）。</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">赢得你的第一次袭击将获得奖励礼物！</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;font-weight:bold\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">添加了银矿石，可制作成工具和盔甲！</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">银矿石在 Y=45 到 Y=-5 之间生成。</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">[版本 1.0.1.1 有一个新的配置项，允许玩家启用或禁用银矿石的生成。]</span></strong></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><strong>2 个新成就：</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>“闪亮！”</strong>：当你获得全新的生银物品时可完成的进度类型成就。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>“矿石收藏家！”</strong>：当你获得游戏中所有可获取矿石的所有材料（包括远古残骸）时可完成的挑战类型成就。<br></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>请随意</strong> <strong>将此模组放入你的整合包中！</strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如果有任何问题，请不要犹豫，告诉我们！</strong></h1>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
